From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:35:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 253/342] meson_decoder: a seek after the end of the stream
 decodes again

Once the stream had ended, a seek stopped the session but left
fOutputEnded set, and _NextFrame() returned B_LAST_BUFFER_ERROR before
starting the next session: no frame after any later seek (H.264, HEVC
and MPEG-1/2 alike; MediaPlayer playing a file again from its end).
Found with mediadecode's seeks on 10 s MPEG-2 files, whose first seek
reaches the end.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/add-ons/media/plugins/meson_decoder/MesonVdecDecoder.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/add-ons/media/plugins/meson_decoder/MesonVdecDecoder.cpp b/src/add-ons/media/plugins/meson_decoder/MesonVdecDecoder.cpp
index a8de22c07b..99bcb54a1f 100644
--- a/src/add-ons/media/plugins/meson_decoder/MesonVdecDecoder.cpp
+++ b/src/add-ons/media/plugins/meson_decoder/MesonVdecDecoder.cpp
@@ -835,6 +835,8 @@ MesonVdecDecoder::SeekedTo(int64 frame, bigtime_t time)
 	}
 	_ReleaseFrame();
 	_StopSession();
+	// a seek after the end of the stream: the next frame starts a session
+	fOutputEnded = false;
 	return B_OK;
 }
 
